# duels-arena's generated per-run results files (see crates/duels-arena);
# arena/.gitkeep keeps the directory itself tracked.
#
# Only the raw per-run game records are ignored. `arena/leaderboard.md` and
# `arena/leaderboard.json` are deliberately NOT ignored: they are the
# leaderboard, so they have to be visible in the repository to be one, and the
# nightly round robin (.github/workflows/nightly-arena.yml) proposes updates to
# them as pull requests. Keep any new ignore rule below scoped to
# `/arena/results/`.
/arena/results/
